WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.042
Loropeni dugu cɛnninw. O ye tarikiko dɔ lo ye.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.888
Bi, Burukina worodugu ni tileben fan fɛ, kogojanw be bɔ yiritu kɔnɔ.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.916
Jɔn lo y'u lɔ? Mun na do? An k'a filɛ wagati be min na.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.210
Ka fara o kan, kabakuruw be wili kelen kelen. O yɔrɔ barakaman lɔra kokura, san kɛmɛ caman tɛmɛnin kɔ.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:57.900
Lohurɔnkaw, minw ye Touna kuntigiw bɛmacɛw ye, olu lo tun siginin bɛ o yɔrɔ la. O ta kogow bɛ yɛlɛnna ɲɔgɔn kan ɲɔgɔn kɔ.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.792
N'a sɔrɔ o kogo ka kan ka to saan kɛmɛkulu caaman kɔnɔ.

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:07.832
A be jamana kɔnɔ fɛɛn nafamanbaw latanga.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:35.194
O ye sanu lo ye. U b'a sama ka bɔ o jamana yɔrɔ bɛɛ la ani bajiw kɔnɔ.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:44.794
Musow b'u ka kabakurulenninw ko. N'a sɔrɔ a be manamana.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:58.826
A ka jan, a ka gbɛlɛn; nka o simanw le bɛ jamana bɛɛ nafa.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:13.696
Dugu barakaman kɔnɔ, warigbɛtigiw bɛ sanin yeele k'a baara kɛ.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.274
Jagokɛlaw be nana ka bɔ yɔrɔjan. O bɛ kɔgɔ ni faniw falen sanin na.

00:02:33.500 --> 00:02:35.900
Aw ye maga a la, a saniyanin lo. "

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:39.531
A ka ɲi, nka a sɔngɔ tun ka gwɛlɛ ne ma.

00:02:39.531 --> 00:02:41.931
O tuma na, kɔgɔ kana kɛ yen tugu!

00:02:48.000 --> 00:02:53.466
Kuntigi ye sanu sɔrɔ a ka lu kɔnɔ. O tuma na, an be to ka dansi.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:25.338
O kɔ, u y'a to o yɔrɔ barikaman tora. Mɔgɔ si t'a lɔn fɛɛn min kama.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:37.490
Dɔɔni ni dɔɔnin, yirituw ka kogow lɔ kokura tuun; yiriw bɛ falen kabakuruw cɛ ra.

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:59.264
Saan 2009 la, Loropeni kɛra Burkina Faso jamana ka yɔrɔ fɔlɔ ye min tɔgɔ lara UNESCO World Heritage site dɔ kan.

00:04:02.000 --> 00:04:05.882
O ye gundo lo ye. Nka, kabakuruw bele be yen.
